final class @locationPredefinedTypeAST : @predefinedTypeAST {

  // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

  override func getSupportedOperatorFlags () -> @typeFeatures {
    result = .generateDescriptionGetterUtilityMethod | .equatable // | .isComparable
  }

  // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

  override proc getClassFunctionMap (?!@unifiedTypeMap ioUnifiedTypeMap,
                                      !@classFunctionMap outMap ) {
    outMap = @()
    enterClassFunctionWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !name:"nowhere",
      !resultTypeName:"location",
      !hasLexiqueArg:false
    )
    enterClassFunctionWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !name:"here",
      !resultTypeName:"location",
      !hasLexiqueArg:true
    )
    enterClassFunctionWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !name: "next",
      !resultTypeName: "location",
      !hasLexiqueArg: true
    )
    enterClassFunctionWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !name: "separator",
      !resultTypeName: "location",
      !hasLexiqueArg: true
    )
  }

  // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

  override proc getGetterMap (?!@unifiedTypeMap ioUnifiedTypeMap,
                               !@getterMap outMap ) {
    commonGetterMapForAllTypes (!?ioUnifiedTypeMap, ?outMap)
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "startLocationString",
      !returnedTypeName:"string",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "endLocationString",
      !returnedTypeName:"string",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "startLocationIndex",
      !returnedTypeName:"uint",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "endLocationIndex",
      !returnedTypeName:"uint",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "file",
      !returnedTypeName:"string",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "startLine",
      !returnedTypeName:"uint",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "endLine",
      !returnedTypeName:"uint",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "startColumn",
      !returnedTypeName:"uint",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "endColumn",
      !returnedTypeName:"uint",
      !hasCompilerArgument:true
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithoutArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "isNowhere",
      !returnedTypeName:"bool",
      !hasCompilerArgument:false
    )
    enterBaseGetterWithArgument (
      !?outMap,
      !?ioUnifiedTypeMap,
      !getterName: "union",
      !argSelector: "", !argType: "location", !argName: "inOtherLocation",
      !returnedTypeName:"location",
      !hasCompilerArgument: true
    )
  }

  // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

  override func cppDeclarationString () -> @string {
    result = filewrapper [predefinedTypeGenerationTemplate.location_type : ]
  }

  // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

}

//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

